{"id":"vod_zy360_25967","vodId":"25967","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"间谍过家家第二季","name_cn":"间谍过家家第二季","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20240113-1/a63f677f614a7e0d1eab62f5d5582cc9.jpg"},"summary":"　　每个人都有不可告人的一面——　　这是一个世界各国均暗地里进行激烈情报战的时代。东国（Ostania）与西国（Westalis）的冷战状态已经持续数十年。“黄昏”是西国情报局东国对策科“WISE”的一名优秀间谍。为调查威胁东西两国和平的人物——东国国家统一党总裁多诺万·德斯蒙，上级给予了他一个绝密任务。　　任务名为：“枭”（Strix）行动。内容是“一周之内组建家庭，潜入德斯蒙儿子就读的名门学校的联谊会”。于是“黄昏”扮演成精神科医生劳埃德·福杰，开始组建家庭。然而，他找来的女儿阿尼亚是个能读心的超能力者，妻子约尔是个杀手。三人利害关系一致，便互相隐瞒身份，开始了共同生活。　　世界的和平，就掌握在这意外不断的临时一家人手中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-06-11 14:28:28","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/3apTUaji/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/JxZ0cKJe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/NN80WM8o/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/eC3gyIaU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/e4rqcWuE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/Hl1dqIvC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/IAFXbY3B/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/x8SVqfxY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/BlJAELTm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/sOdnu6qX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/wrSuROUk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/po1LK5Rl/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:33.646Z"}